msgid "* Error alerts during installation generally do not prevent the program from working correctly."
msgstr "* Feilmeldinger under installasjonen hindrer vanligvis ikke programmet fra å fungere korrekt."
msgid "Read before proceeding with the installation:"
msgstr "Les før du fortsetter med installasjonen:"
msgid ""
"Prefer native packages, built for BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch, or other Linux systems compatible with "
"the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Another option is to use programs made for any Linux system, usually in <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span>, or <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"If the program is not available in the formats above, the <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> file "
"can be converted to <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> and installed on this system. However, "
"the installation may not work correctly."
msgstr ""
"Foretre native pakker, bygget for BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch eller andre Linux-systemer som er "
"kompatible med <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span>-formatet.\n"
"\n"
"Et annet alternativ er å bruke programmer laget for ethvert Linux-system, vanligvis i <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span> eller <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span>-format.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis programmet ikke er tilgjengelig i formatene ovenfor, kan <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.deb</span>-filen konverteres til <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> og "
"installeres på dette systemet. Imidlertid kan installasjonen hende ikke fungere korrekt."
msgid ""
"<big>This system uses the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> package format, but the file is in "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to proceed with the installation?</big>\n"
msgstr ""
"<big>Dette systemet bruker <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> pakkeformat, men filen er i <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Ønsker du å fortsette med installasjonen?</big>"
msgid "Install & Review Config Files"
msgstr "Installer og vurder konfigurasjonsfiler"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installer"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Lukk"
msgid "Install .deb package"
msgstr "Installer .deb-pakke"
msgid "Converting file, please wait. This may take a few minutes..."
msgstr "Konverterer fil, vennligst vent. Dette kan ta noen minutter..."
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "Ferdig!"
